  "summary": "AIOHTTP: Cookie from subdomain can remove Host-Only Scope from existing cookies",
  "details": "### Summary\n\nA subdomain can remove the Host-Only flag from an existing cookie to a parent domain.\n\n### Impact\n\nA user accessing untrusted subdomains could see their Host-Only protections stripped from cookies. Given most usecases won't reflect these cookies to a browser, the impact is limited.",
